30 │ /**
31 │  * Converts a venue time without a zone, such as `2026-10-12T10:00` from a `datetime-local` input, to UTC ISO 8601.
32 │  * An hour that the spring clock change skips moves one hour forward. An hour that occurs twice in autumn is winter time.
33 │  */
